+{"$schema":"fabro-journal-v1","run_id":"01M1VZTJSZ551NFPHPXD429MG0","node":"planner","visit":1,"status":"succeeded","ts":"2026-09-06T18:33:22Z","data":{"painpoints":["Session start hit untrusted mise config: first `sd ready` exited 1 with 'Config files in /repos/denkhaus/fabro/.mise.toml are not trusted', burning a call on `mise trust` before any tracker work (this run, planner stage). Seed fabro-66db tracks pre-trusting mise in run containers; the same fix would cover agent stages here."],"observations":["fabro-3d97 (top High, ready) has no literal `Basis:` line but was created 2026-09-06 and its claim verified in-tree: `lib/apps/fabro-server/src/server/automation_scheduler.rs` never observes fired-run outcomes, and the existing circuit breaker in `lib/components/fabro-workflow/src/lifecycle/circuit_breaker.rs` is per-run loop-scoped — different layer, no collision.","Spec ambiguity resolved in the brief: 'keyed on failure.signature OR (workflow, park-reason)' — brief pins failure.signature primary with (workflow, park-reason) as fallback key, so the reviewer judges one scheme.","140 ready seeds; High-priority backlog is deep (fabro-de4d, fabro-94e8 next) — later runs have plenty to claim."]}}
